{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch73TDSA2mWUaftez9Czy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the card for Ridgeview, since that's where you're starting. I left out the coffee line on purpose, and I think you should drop it everywhere.\n\n**Why I left out the coffee line:**\n- **The math doesn't hold up.** At the city median ($410,000), the levy is about $78 a year, or **$6.49 a month**. In Ridgeview ($640,000), it's about $122 a year, or **$10.13 a month**. That's more than a cup of coffee in most places, and the gap is wider in Ridgeview, where you're starting.\n- **The opposition will pounce on it.** The neighborhood association president is already calling the levy a \"blank check.\" If a retiree on a fixed income works out their own bill and gets $10 a month instead of the \"less than a cup of coffee\" a volunteer told them, that's an easy letter to the editor and it hurts your credibility. The last levy lost by 4 points, so you can't afford that.\n- **\"Average household\" is misleading.** Your figure is a median, not an average. And 38% of households rent, so they don't get a levy bill directly.\n\nThe real number is still small and specific, and specific numbers persuade skeptical voters better than slogans. I put it right on the card, along with a quick way for people to work out their own bill.\n\n**Check before printing:**\n1. Does the ballot language legally dedicate the money to library operations? If it does, add \"by law\" to the \"blank check\" answer. It's a stronger reply.\n2. Does your county have a senior or fixed-income property tax relief program? If so, add one line about it to the fixed-income answer. In Ridgeview, that could be your most useful line.\n3. Make a citywide version of the card by swapping in the $410,000 home: about $78 a year, or $6.50 a month.\n\nThe spoken part is about 170 words, which takes about 75 seconds at a normal pace.\n\n<final_document>\n**YES ON MEASURE 4: Library Levy · Ridgeview Door Script**\n\n**OPEN**\n\"Hi, I'm [NAME]. I'm a volunteer with Yes on Measure 4, the library levy on the March ballot. Do you have a minute?\"\n\n**ASK**\n\"Do you or anyone in your household use the Ridgeview library?\" *(Listen. Let them talk.)*\n\n**WHAT'S AT STAKE**\n\"If Measure 4 doesn't pass, the Ridgeview branch closes in July. Measure 4 keeps it open and brings back Sunday hours at all five branches. People are using the library more than ever: visits are up 22% since 2021.\"\n\n**WHAT IT COSTS**\n\"It's 19 cents for every $1,000 of assessed value. For a typical Ridgeview home, about $640,000, that's around $120 a year, or about $10 a month. It ends after six years.\"\n\n**CLOSE**\n\"The last library levy lost by just 4 points, so every vote matters. Can we count on your yes vote on Measure 4 in March?\"\n*(Record: Yes / Leaning yes / Undecided / No. Offer a lit piece.)*\n\n---\n\n**IF THEY SAY…**\n\n**\"It's a blank check.\"**\n\"I understand the concern. It's a fixed rate, it ends after six years, and what it pays for is spelled out: Sunday hours at all five branches and keeping Ridgeview open.\"\n\n**\"I'm on a fixed income.\"**\n\"That's completely fair. Here's how to work out your own bill: take your assessed value, drop the last three zeros, and multiply by 19 cents. A $500,000 home pays $95 a year.\"\n\n**\"I rent.\"**\n\"It's a property tax, so it goes on the owner's bill. But the library is for everyone, and Ridgeview's branch is what's at stake.\"\n\n**Always:** Be friendly, stick to the facts on this card, and never argue. If you don't know an answer, say so and offer to have someone follow up.\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5459,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5459},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7583c935-2714-4cab-a3b2-2fc1c1a967e9","uuid":"b8913cc5-3d09-46d9-bfcf-e3eec5b3cf16","timestamp":"2026-11-16T18:00:32.591Z","request_id":"req_011Ch73TDAHEeX4GykvyyuUJ"}
